# Booking domain

Enforce these rules in backend services, not in React.

- 30-minute slot increment.
- No buffer between sessions.
- No minimum notice (D-30): same-day slots start from the next 30-minute start that has not begun. No booking path may accept a start in the past; only payment confirmation of an existing hold may use `allowStarted`.
- One session at a time across every package: overlap is enforced by the `StudioResource` row lock + `slotFits`, backed by the `Booking_no_overlap` exclusion constraint.
- `COMPLETED` / `NO_SHOW` cannot be set before the session starts.
- Packages occupy their full duration (a 90-minute package blocks 90 minutes).
- 5% online discount (backend `PricingService` only).
- 15% rescheduling fee (of original package price).
- Silent 15-minute slot hold (`TEMPORARY_HOLD`) — no hold email/countdown, never blocks payment. Checkout renews an expired hold if the slot is still free; otherwise the second customer gets 409 "slot just booked, pick another time". Late payments are placed under the studio lock or flagged `PAID_UNPLACED`. Expired holds release the slot.
- No customer cancellation or refund. Admin may cancel; `NO_SHOW` is distinct from `CANCELLED`.

Availability blockers: `TEMPORARY_HOLD`, `PENDING`, `CONFIRMED`. Timezone: store UTC, display `Africa/Lagos`.
